From e6ba767751191c05129fe89971ca3f4ed6b82d53 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: alex-PT78 <alex@example.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 22:45:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add Razer Huntsman V3 X TKL (02B1) support, rebased on
 upstream v3.12.1

- Add USB ID 0x02B1 in razerkbd_driver.h, udev, README
- Mirror BlackWidow V4 X protocol (report 0x02, 0x1F/0x3F/0xFF as appropriate)
- Fix game_led_state fallthrough bug (uninitialized request)
- Fix daemon EVENT_FILE_REGEX NK/TKL -> Tenkeyless, add optional if01
- Use _RippleKeyboard with full METHODS (wheel/game/macro/ripple) and WAVE_DIRS
- MATRIX_DIMS [6,18] for TKL layout
- Add fake driver cfg for tests
---
 README.md                                     |  1 +
 daemon/openrazer_daemon/hardware/keyboards.py | 22 ++++++++++++++-
 driver/razerkbd_driver.c                      | 27 +++++++++++++++++++
 driver/razerkbd_driver.h                      |  1 +
 install_files/udev/99-razer.rules             |  2 +-
 .../_fake_driver/razerhuntsmanv3xtkl.cfg      | 25 +++++++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 76 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 pylib/openrazer/_fake_driver/razerhuntsmanv3xtkl.cfg

