 | Razer Huntsman V3 Pro Mini                                    |  1532:02B0  |
+| Razer Huntsman V3 X TKL                                       |  1532:02B1  |
 | Razer Blade 14 (2024)                                         |  1532:02B6  |
 | Razer Blade 18 (2024)                                         |  1532:02B8  |
